+      "id": "RULE-COMMIT-002",
+      "kind": "rule",
+      "scope": "COMMIT",
+      "enforcement": "review",
+      "content": {
+        "bullets": [
+          "The scope is the owning package in **dot notation**, including the module segment — never a\n  slash path.\n  * `cfapi/models/accounts` → `cfapi.models.accounts`\n  * `cfapi/db/postgres/apps` → `cfapi.db.postgres.apps`",
+          "Directories without package semantics use the same dot notation: `docs.general`, `docs.plans.login_simplification`,\n  `.claude`, `scripts`, `vendor`.",
+          "An infra change spanning sibling roots may list them, comma-separated (no conjunction — RULE-COMMIT-008):\n  ```\n  vendor, go.mod, go.sum: Added dependencies for login simplification\n  ```"
+        ],
+        "statement": "The scope is the owning package in dot notation including the module segment — never a file path."
+      },
+      "reach": "global",
+      "version": "1.0",
+      "source": "/Users/devuser/GolandProjects/smine/context/rules/commits.md",
+      "origin": "baseline"
+    },
