+      "kind": "rule",
+      "scope": "COMMIT",
+      "enforcement": "review",
+      "content": {
+        "bullets": [
+          "Use the `<Symbol>:` second prefix **only** when the entire commit concerns one existing symbol —\n  adding funcs to it, or modifying it.",
+          "**Introducing** a new symbol does NOT take a second prefix (`Config: Added struct Config` is\n  redundant) — use the type-kinded body form instead (RULE-COMMIT-006).",
