+
+* Tests → **TESTS** section below (`RULE-GOLANG-TEST-*`, `RULE-GOLANG-ASSERT-*`)
+* Goroutines → **GOROUTINES** section below (`RULE-GOLANG-GR-*`)
+* SQL → `sql.md` next to this file (`RULE-SQL-*`, `RULE-SQL-DBMCP-*`)
